{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared parity corpus for the Connect retry-eligibility vocabulary.",
    "Both language implementations answer THESE cases; neither keeps its own",
    "copy. The signature list used to be transcribed into each language by",
    "hand and agreed only because two authors typed the same seven strings —",
    "one case per signature below is what turns that coincidence into a",
    "contract.",
    "",
    "code/message are the inputs. The four expectations are the four questions",
    "the vocabulary answers, and every language must answer all four the same."
  ],
